{"text": " AI's gonna start beating salespeople earlier than you'd think. Not because they are better on the phone or they're gonna sound better, but simply because they do two things better than humans. First is they're gonna get to leads faster, meaning what normally takes a human maybe 20 minutes or even two hours in the worst case scenario, which is like 80% of businesses, two days to get to their leads, they'll be able to get to it in seconds. The second thing is that if the person doesn't answer the phone or doesn't respond back, they're gonna do the other thing that humans don't do, which is they're going to try again. And they're gonna follow up and they're gonna follow up perfectly for extended periods of time. And so right now, one, incorporating AI into your sales process is not a nice to have, but a need to have. And number two, always remember that today is the worst it will ever be.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.0600000000000005, "text": " AI's gonna start beating salespeople earlier than you'd think.", "tokens": [50364, 7318, 311, 799, 722, 13497, 5763, 21123, 3071, 813, 291, 1116, 519, 13, 50567], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11881657706366645, "compression_ratio": 1.9538904899135447, "no_speech_prob": 0.0024464435409754515}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.0600000000000005, "end": 6.8, "text": " Not because they are better on the phone", "tokens": [50567, 1726, 570, 436, 366, 1101, 322, 264, 2593, 50704], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11881657706366645, "compression_ratio": 1.9538904899135447, "no_speech_prob": 0.0024464435409754515}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.8, "end": 8.1, "text": " or they're gonna sound better,", "tokens": [50704, 420, 436, 434, 799, 1626, 1101, 11, 50769], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11881657706366645, "compression_ratio": 1.9538904899135447, "no_speech_prob": 0.0024464435409754515}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 8.1, "end": 10.78, "text": " but simply because they d